# Blade & public UI

## Responsibility
- Blade = layout, copy via `__()`, links, light display conditionals.
- No duplicated business rules in `@php` blocks (commissions, eligibility, payment confirmation).
- Prefer partials under `partials/landing/mycourses/` and existing layouts.

## Styling
- Public marketing: follow `.cursor/skills/hesetak-public-pages` + rule `hesetak-public-pages.mdc`.
- Use `mc-*` / `meras-shop` tokens. No new CSS framework.
- Brand mark: `partials/landing/mycourses/brand` + `img/brand/hesetak-mark.png`.

## i18n
- User-facing strings in `lang/ar` + `lang/en`.
- Brand word: `__('landing.nav.brand')` (حصتك / Hesetak).
- No hardcoded long copy when a lang key fits.

## CX
- Default audience: student/parent + 1:1 + curricula + courses.
- Each page: one target, one job, one primary CTA (see skill `page-experience.md`).
- No teacher-PD-only as whole-site identity; no مرجعي UX.

## Assets
- Descriptive filenames; reuse `public/img/brand/` and existing landing images.
